. use "$path/hh02dta_b3b/iiib_tp.dta", clear
(VERSION (ene 19))

. * We specifically look at remmittances in the united states because it has a 
> overwhelming frequncy of 301/310, the other countries are barely any
. * We code the missing appropiately. 1 is US, 0 is same location aka Mexico or
>  a different country, . missing is categorized as don't know or genuinely mis
> sing. Note: Need to add upper. 
. gen mother_us = .
