. replace father_us = 0 if tp18pp_1 == 3
(14,100 real changes made)

. replace father_us = 0 if tp18pp_1 == 1 & upper(tp18pp_2) != "UNITED STATES" &
>  !missing(tp18pp_2)
(9 real changes made)

. replace father_us = 1 if tp18pp_1 == 1 & upper(tp18pp_2) == "UNITED STATES"
(301 real changes made)

. 
. * TP02 = 1, parent lives in the household, need to code bc of skip logic in q
> uestionaire
. * TP03 = 1, parent died more than 12 months ago, need to code bc of skip logi
> c in questionaire
