. *******************************************************************
. * Child-Level Controls: Vaccination, Delivery & Breastfeeding
. *******************************************************************
. 
. * Child Vaccination (Book 5, v_vac), this is a clean individual child level c
> ontrol
. * NOTE THIS CONTROL IS RATHER CUMBERSOME
. use "$path/hh02dta_b5/v_vac.dta", clear
(VERSION (ene 19))

. * Does the child have a vaccination card, dates copied off the card, and then
>  a recall quesiton asking the parents if their child was vaccinated.
. * NOTE: Same as 2005, 2002 has only ONE card (vac02). There is no vac02_a (pr
> evious card), and the card dates are vac03a-vac03u with no _1/_2 suffix. 
. keep folio ls vac02 vac03a-vac03u vac04a vac04b vac04c vac04d vac04e vac04f v
> ac04g vac04h

. rename vac02 has_vaccination_card

. * IMPORTANT NOTE: Skip pattern, VAC04 is asked ONLY when no card is seen. If 
> a card is seen VAC02 = 1 the interviewer copies the dates into VAC03 and skip
> s VAC04.
. 
. * This generates a categorical variable that denotes if 1 = you had a card, 2
>  = a previous card, or 3 = a recall.
. * Note: No previous card in 2002, so there is no card_src = 2 line. We keep t
> he same numbering as 2009 (1 = card, 3 = recall)
. gen byte card_src = 1 if has_vaccination_card == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. replace card_src = 3 if inlist(has_vaccination_card, 2, 3)
(4,362 real changes made)

. 
. * Writing a loop to check if there is a date corresponding with if the child 
> is vaccinated. So r_ = 1 if the card shows the dose was given a real date, an
> d 0 if the box is blank.
. * NOTE: Different from 2005 and 2009. In 2002 the card dates are NUMBERS not 
> text (e.g. 70596 = 07/05/96), so trim()/substr() would not work. Also the 200
> 2 questionnaire has no "45" (too young) code. An empty box is stored as 44000
> 0. We checked that 440000 means NOT given. So 440000 = 0. 
. * Not used in the regressions, if you use, will need to come back and slightl
> y change the code 
. foreach v of varlist vac03a-vac03u {
  2.     gen byte r_`v' = (!missing(`v') & `v' != 440000)
  3. }

. 
. * Combining doses into vaccines, so if a child got any of these doses and the
> ir card was seen (card_src = 1) then it is 1.
. * Also note: many children in 2002 were born before the 1999 pentavalent roll
> out (they got DPT instead) and before MMR replaced the single measles vaccine
> , so their fully_vaccinated is lower. This is the real schedule, not a coding
>  error. 
. gen byte v_penta = max(r_vac03i, r_vac03j, r_vac03k) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_bcg = r_vac03a if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_polio = max(r_vac03b, r_vac03c, r_vac03d, r_vac03e, r_vac03f, r_va
> c03g, r_vac03h) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_dpt = max(v_penta, r_vac03l, r_vac03m, r_vac03n, r_vac03o, r_vac03
> p) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_mmr = max(r_vac03r, r_vac03s) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_measles = max(v_mmr, r_vac03q) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. gen byte v_hepb = max(v_penta, r_vac03t) if card_src == 1
(6,002 missing values generated)

. 
. 
. * For recall (card_src = 3), we use a nesting condition. Basicall if parent a
> nswered yes then 1, no(3) then 0, and don't know or missing is set to missing
> .
. replace v_bcg = cond(vac04a == 1, 1, cond(vac04a == 3, 0, .)) if card_src == 
> 3
(4,137 real changes made)

. replace v_polio = cond(vac04b == 1, 1, cond(vac04b == 3, 0, .)) if card_src =
> = 3
(4,134 real changes made)

. replace v_dpt = cond(vac04c == 1, 1, cond(vac04c == 3, 0, .)) if card_src == 
> 3
(4,044 real changes made)

. replace v_penta = cond(vac04d == 1, 1, cond(vac04d == 3, 0, .)) if card_src =
> = 3
(3,843 real changes made)

. replace v_mmr = cond(vac04e == 1, 1, cond(vac04e == 3, 0, .)) if card_src == 
> 3
(3,942 real changes made)

. replace v_measles = cond(vac04f == 1 | vac04e == 1, 1, cond(vac04f == 3 & vac
> 04e == 3, 0, .)) if card_src == 3
